.DS_Store

# Marketing capture scratch. The viewer's ?demo&pitch mode draws synthetic
# gradients, so a capture of it never matches the real photos every other
# beat shows. To capture the gallery honestly, drop the real photos in
# _capshots/ and generate _capgallery.html (view.html plus a small script
# that swaps the gradients for them), serve the folder, and shoot it
# headless. Both are throwaway — and _capshots/ holds personal photos that
# must never reach a public repo.
_capshots/
_capgallery.html
